WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:03.300
Here are two groups of dots. Which is bigger?

2
00:03.300 --> 00:05.500
Count each group. 7 and 4.

3
00:05.500 --> 00:08.800
The left group has 3 extra dots. It is bigger.

4
00:08.800 --> 00:12.600
This is the greater than sign. Its mouth opens toward the bigger number.

5
00:12.600 --> 00:15.800
7 > 4. Seven is greater than four.
